---
source: default-plugins/status-bar/src/keybind_hints.rs
expression: listing
---
== Pane
wide:   <n> New / <←↓↑→> Change Focus / <x> Close / <c> Rename / <f> Toggle Fullscreen / <w> Toggle Floating / <e> Toggle Embed / <r> Split Right / <d> Split Down / <s> Stack / <ENTER> Select pane
tight:  <n> New / <←↓↑→> Move / <x> Close / <c> Rename ... 

== Tab
wide:   <n> New / <←→> Change focus / <x> Close / <r> Rename / <s> Sync / <b> Break pane to new tab / <[]> Break pane left/right / <TAB> Toggle / <ENTER> Select pane
tight:  <n> New / <←→> Move / <x> Close / <r> Rename ... 

== Session
wide:   <d> Detach / <w> Session Manager / <s> Share / <c> Configure / <l> Layout Manager / <p> Plugin Manager / <a> About / <ENTER> Select pane
tight:  <d> Detach / <w> Manager / <s> Share / <c> Config ... 

== Move
wide:   <←↓↑→> Switch Location / <ENTER> When done
tight:  <←↓↑→> Switch Location / <ENTER> When done
